巫女中最缺乏危机感的一位，不知是因为修行不足，还是因为已经拥有足够的实力。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她天生地幸运和敏锐，也退治了不少妖怪。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"485"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"485","value":"人类"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"485","value":"主要是在空中飞行的程度的能力"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"485","value":"作为博丽巫女的能力"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"485","value":"在空中飞行的程度的能力"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"485","value":"操纵灵气的程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f3/f33007c417ade7c73b7ee78244285c2ff601da86919605a6f56c0570deb01c0c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fc/fc26d83763ce8144e0a342eaeb5a41bf3e1756ec782d0268170ef9bac39c8489.webp","width":237,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_486","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1146"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1148"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1150"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1151"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1153"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1155"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1157"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1160"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"12696"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"131875"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1395"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"329342"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"430567"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"5752"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"73138"}]},"originalCharacterName":"霧雨魔理沙","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"居住于魔法森林的人类魔法使，常骑着扫把，「霧雨店」的独生女。會使用魔法森林的蘑菇調製火藥，所使用的魔法幾乎只有把東西破壞的效果，而且燃料需要長時間準備，但是其效果非常強力，在Spell Card規則成立下，純粹的破壞力在人類當中屬於最高等級。此外在幻想乡是出了名的小偷，帕邱莉的图书馆、香霖堂，如果不是古明地觉会读心术，甚至连地灵殿都会惨遭毒手。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"486"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"486","value":"人类"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"486","value":"使用魔法程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0e/0e00e4df671f5f80d5733c44e4b69596b901aad88177fc335789c2dd5ea6b2d6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a3/a3bd6c6ab5c1df20f216ccf8f7e1581841d4fed04fe2cad0f92ce726df7fb8d1.webp","width":237,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_489","characterName":"纳兹琳","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"489","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1395"},{"characterId":"489","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"430567"},{"characterId":"489","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"5752"}]},"originalCharacterName":"纳兹琳","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"虽然她是寅丸星的使魔鼠妖，但是实际上她是真正的毘沙门天派来的高等级妖怪。是派来帮助和监视寅丸星工作的。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她的特技是探宝。所谓的探宝，本意是指搜寻地下埋藏的水脉，但是她的能力并不仅限于此，更多的时候是在探寻财宝。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一般的探宝的方法，会到使用探测棒，震动摆探测器等。但是她是使用野生老鼠来作为探测器的。因为无论是多么狭小或者深邃的地方都能钻进去，所以可以通过听声辨位来确认所寻之物的所在处。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"也并非是什么样的东西都可以找到。那些太大的东西（×1 太大的东西老鼠反而看不见。）、如同饵食一样能吃的东西（×2 会吃掉的。）、活着的动物（×3 猫。），都不是它们擅长寻找的东西。还有，让老鼠收集那些它们无法辨识、无法理解的东西，也是比较困难的。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"虽然她的身材不大，但是性格却是出奇的骄傲自大。不过这是因为有毘沙门天做她的后盾，其实她的性格是比较胆小的。一旦遇到什么可怕的事情立刻就逃之夭夭了。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"489"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"489","value":"鼠妖"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"489","value":"要搜寻东西就能搜寻到的能力（星莲船、求闻口授）"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5b/5b6a6f96cfaf5d5063c42785b3e386e769c073e92a6e656678ac6fd1f6328081.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9c/9cba464b83875f3464f6b9958ffcc371ddd61b045cb6bad8e4a53ccdb14c960a.webp","width":157,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_889","characterName":"東風谷 早苗","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"889","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"889","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"12696"},{"characterId":"889","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"131875"},{"characterId":"889","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1395"},{"characterId":"889","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"},{"characterId":"889","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"329342"},{"characterId":"889","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"430567"},{"characterId":"889","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"5752"}]},"originalCharacterName":"東風谷 早苗","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"住在妖怪之山上的守矢神社的巫女。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"889"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"889","